  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/description",
    "raw": "Mantizi History: The Fall of an Empire",
    "value": "甲虫族历史: 帝国的衰落"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "It wasn't their military spending, their scientific experiments or their inherently unlikable natures that cost the Mantizi their empirical might. No, it was something else entirely that contributed to the downfall of their once great civilization. Expansionism brought them to the death-knell, as it were.",
    "value": "令甲虫族失去其实证力量的，并非军费开支、科学实验，亦非其天生不讨喜的秉性。不，真正令他们伟大文明倾覆的，全然是另一事由。扩张主义，可谓将其推至丧钟鸣响之边缘。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Having spread too rapidly and too far among the neighboring systems stressed their economy until it reached an inevitable breaking point. The Mantizi, never great with money in the first place (they are far too hard-coded to use current resources for short-term gain, due in part to their natural evolution as a species), were not even aware of a problem until it was too late.",
    "value": "由于在邻近星系中扩张过快过广，其经济承受重压，终至不可避免的崩溃临界。甲虫族素来不擅理财（其天性使然，过于倾向利用现有资源谋取短期利益），乃至问题显现时，已为时过晚。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Within twenty years, the coffers of the empire were empty. Workers could no longer be paid, and the unemployment rate rapidly reached over 87% (estimated 87.72% at the official time of dissolution). What followed was a massive civil war, and the complete slaughter of every single member of the senate. Even the Oracles were slain, their entrails used as sashes.",
    "value": "不出二十年，帝国金库告罄。工人无饷可发，失业率迅速突破87%（官方解散时统计约为87.72%）。随之而来的是大规模内战，以及参议院全体成员的彻底屠戮。纵是先知亦遭杀害，其内脏被抽作腰带。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "The citizens attempted to replace the government, but too much damage had already been done. The empire, as it was, ceased to exist. The estimated death tally across their entire territory is 4,245,167,211.",
    "value": "民众虽试图重建政府，然疮痍已深。帝国实质已亡。全境死亡人数估计为4,245,167,211人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "What remains now are numerous tribes. They cling to individual worlds, though their tendency to live lives of excess has not diminished in the least. At last count, the remaining Mantizi worlds still house over 65 billion individuals. Of that population, 32% are Artisans or Artists, 7% are philosophers, 8% work in brothels or similar professions. Clearly Mantizi enjoy expression.",
    "value": "如今所存，唯余诸多部落。他们固守各自世界，而奢靡之风未见稍减。据最新统计，现存甲虫族星球仍居有超过650亿人口。其中32%为工匠或艺术家，7%为哲学家，8%就职于妓院或类似行业。显然，甲虫族钟情表达。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "We cannot neglect to mention their natural combat abilities. Despite the empire no longer being a power, the old ways remain popular and are well practiced among the majority of their people due to the Vorgeth Cygna Doctrine still being held as a 'core' Virtue (a fancy way of Mantizi saying 'mandatory learning for the good of all').",
    "value": "我们亦不可忽视其天生的战斗才能。虽帝国不再为强国，因沃格斯·西格纳信条仍被奉为“核心”美德（即甲虫族所谓“为众生利益强制修习”的雅称），古老战技依旧盛行，为多数民众所熟习。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/6",
    "raw": "Only time will tell if they can once again forge a lasting empire and unite the tribes. They would be welcome voices in the Protectorate, should they once again create a viable government.",
    "value": "唯时间能证，他们能否再建持久帝国，统合诸部。若其再立可行之政府，大地守护团将欣然迎其声量。"
  }
]